  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/018N">Lemma <span data-tag="018N">14.21.3</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{C}$ be a category which has finite colimits. Let $U$ be an $m$-truncated simplicial object of $\mathcal{C}$. The map $U \to \text{sk}_ m i_{m!}U$ is an isomorphism. </p>
